      "widgets_values": [
        "This FLUX workflow keeps the same four control branches as the original SD1.5 workflow: Depth, Canny, LineArt and Layout/Seg. All four branches are structurally connected. The Seg branch is mapped to manycore-research/FLUX.1-Layout-ControlNet and uses the existing semantic segmentation preprocessor output as the control image."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
